ont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">消息称百度昆仑芯将赴港IPO 目标估值达500亿美元</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">北京大学与DeepSeek联合开源大模型推理加速框架DSpark</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI与韩国人工智能安全研究所签署合作备忘录，共同推进AI安全评估</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">马斯克宣布Grok4.5开启内测，SpaceX计划今年每月发布全新基础模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/09656903ecd9ae90ac93424907c5c568.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">埃隆·马斯克于2026年6月28日宣布，xAI旗下最新大语言模型Grok4.5已在SpaceX与特斯拉内部启动Beta测试。该模型基于1.5万亿参数的V9基础模型构建，并深度融合了AI编程工具Cursor的数据，早期评测显示其性能已比肩Anthropic旗舰模型Claude Opus。马斯克明确提出激进的迭代计划，即SpaceX在今年剩余时间内将每月推出一个完全从零训练的全新基础模型，而非简单的版本迭代。此次布局与SpaceX拟以600亿美元收购Cursor开发商Anysphere的战略动作高度协同。通过在SpaceX与特斯拉的实体产业场景中进行高频测试，xAI旨在获取高价值反馈，加速模型优化，并进一步强化在编码辅助及企业级AI市场的竞争优势，此举将显著提升行业大模型迭代的竞争节奏。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果Vision Pro硬件负责人保罗·米德跳槽OpenAI，加速AI原生硬件研发</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4ffa9b292743b22d3ca04e2dd58eb3da.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI近日正式聘请苹果视觉产品集团（VPG）前负责人保罗·米德（Paul Meade）加入其硬件部门，负责推动AI原生硬件设备的研发。米德在苹果任职期间曾领导Apple Vision Pro硬件团队长达七年，并主导了苹果首款智能眼镜的开发工作。此次人事变动正值苹果内部架构重组，米德的加入将为OpenAI提供顶级的空间计算与可穿戴硬件研发经验。此前，OpenAI已与前苹果首席设计师Jony Ive及LoveFrom团队合作成立子公司“io”，旨在打造AI原生硬件产品。米德的加盟标志着OpenAI在AI软硬件一体化领域的战略布局进一步升级，预示着科技巨头在AI设备赛道的竞争将进入白热化阶段。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">消息称百度昆仑芯将赴港IPO 目标估值达500亿美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b42360a551d2af392abf0b84b34462ba.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">消息称百度昆仑芯将赴港IPO 目标估值达500亿美元AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Jun 29, 20262066月29日，资本市场传来重磅消息，百度旗下AI芯片业务主体昆仑芯正在紧锣密鼓地推进香港首次公开募股（IPO）相关进程，目标估值高达500亿美元。作为百度AI硬件生态布局的核心板块，昆仑芯此次奔赴港股不仅是其自身资本化道路的里程碑，也为当前白热化的全球AI算力市场注入了新的催化剂。作为国内备受瞩目的AI算力企业，昆仑芯此前已成功推出多代自研AI芯片，并在云端推理等多元化算力场景中实现了大规模落地应用。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">北京大学与DeepSeek联合开源大模型推理加速框架DSpark</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/dbd8258dd3c8d4d98c4d605ceca02ad6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">6月28日，北京大学与DeepSeek联合发布并开源大模型推理加速框架DSpark，旨在解决大语言模型高并发推理场景下的响应延迟与算力浪费问题。DSpark引入双重优化机制：在候选生成阶段采用半自回归架构，仅需两层Transformer结构即可实现优于五层并行模型的效果；在验证调度层面，通过硬件感知前缀调度器实时判断负载，减少无效计算。经通义千问3、Gemma4等模型测试，DSpark在长序列生成任务中有效缓解了候选有效率衰减难题，表现优于Eagle3和DFlash。工程层面，该框架通过序列打包降低内存消耗，并采用异步调度消除GPU流水线卡顿。目前，DSpark已应用于DeepSeek-V4-Flash与DeepSeek-V4-Pro预览版服务，显著提升了系统吞吐量。DeepSeek已在GitHub DeepS</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI与韩国人工智能安全研究所签署合作备忘录，共同推进AI安全评估</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/04bd262e29e0472ec5b42c635c48be1b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正式与韩国人工智能安全研究所签署合作备忘录，成为继美国、英国、日本之后，OpenAI在全球范围内达成的第四项国家级AI安全合作。双方将聚焦高级AI系统在网络安全等高风险领域的评估，重点涵盖安全评估方法、基准测试及技术信息交流。合作旨在共同探索高性能AI模型和自主AI智能体的风险评估机制，确保部署前后的潜在风险可控。此外，双方计划定制专属的韩语测试数据与评估标准，以识别传统英文测试中难以发现的本地化风险，并致力于构建国际通用的AI安全基准框架。尽管目前协议尚未明确具体评估产品及实施截止日期，但此次深度协作标志着双方在构建AI信任体系与降低技术风险方面迈出关键一步，为后续跨国界AI安全治理提供了创新空间。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
